{"seq":1,"slug":"clinical-pharmacy","title":"大学药学 — 临床药学实践","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/pharmacy/pharmacy-practice/clinical-pharmacy","wordCount":2025,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学药学-临床药学实践\">大学药学 — 临床药学实践</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>临床药学（Clinical Pharmacy）是药学与临床医学交叉的实践学科，核心使命是确保患者用药的安全性、有效性和经济性。临床药师直接参与医疗团队的工作，从处方审核到药物治疗方案的制定和监测，发挥着不可替代的作用。随着&quot;以患者为中心&quot;的医疗理念深入人心，临床药学的地位在全球范围内持续提升。在中国，2017 年《关于加强药事管理转变药学服务模式的通知》标志着临床药师制度建设进入新阶段。</p>\n<p>核心实践领域：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>药物治疗管理</strong>：基于循证医学原则优化个体化用药方案</li>\n<li><strong>处方审核与干预</strong>：识别并纠正不合理用药</li>\n<li><strong>治疗药物监测（TDM）</strong>：对窄治疗窗药物进行血药浓度监测</li>\n<li><strong>药物不良反应监测</strong>：ADR 的识别、评估、报告和管理</li>\n<li><strong>患者用药教育</strong>：提高患者依从性和自我管理能力</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-药物治疗管理-mtm\">一、药物治疗管理（MTM）</h3><p>药物治疗管理是临床药师的核心职能，系统化流程包括：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[收集患者信息] --&gt; B[药物治疗评估]&#10;    B --&gt; C[识别药物治疗问题]&#10;    C --&gt; D[制定治疗计划]&#10;    D --&gt; E[实施干预]&#10;    E --&gt; F[随访与疗效评估]&#10;    F --&gt;|需调整| B&#10;    F --&gt;|达标| G[持续监测]\">graph TD\n    A[收集患者信息] --&gt; B[药物治疗评估]\n    B --&gt; C[识别药物治疗问题]\n    C --&gt; D[制定治疗计划]\n    D --&gt; E[实施干预]\n    E --&gt; F[随访与疗效评估]\n    F --&gt;|需调整| B\n    F --&gt;|达标| G[持续监测]</pre><p>**药物治疗问题（Drug Therapy Problems，DTP）**的分类：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>DTP 类型</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>实例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>需要药物治疗但未给予</td>\n<td>有适应证但未使用</td>\n<td>糖尿病合并高血压未用 ACEI/ARB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>使用了不必要的药物</td>\n<td>无适应证或重复用药</td>\n<td>无感染证据使用抗菌药</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>药物选择不当</td>\n<td>非最佳选择或有禁忌</td>\n<td>肾功能不全使用肾毒性药物</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>剂量不足</td>\n<td>低于有效治疗剂量</td>\n<td>根据体重计算剂量不足</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>剂量过大</td>\n<td>超过推荐剂量</td>\n<td>未根据肾功能调整给药间隔</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>药物不良反应</td>\n<td>需要处理的 ADR</td>\n<td>他汀类引起的肌痛</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>依从性不佳</td>\n<td>未按医嘱用药</td>\n<td>自行停用降压药</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"二-处方审核与合理用药\">二、处方审核与合理用药</h3><p>处方审核是临床药师的法定职责。审核要点包括：</p>\n<p><strong>适应证审核</strong>：处方药物是否与诊断相符。抗菌药物处方需要特别关注——是否有感染证据（血象、培养结果、影像学），选择的抗菌谱是否覆盖可能的致病菌。</p>\n<p><strong>剂量与给药方案审核</strong>：特殊人群（肝肾功能不全、老年人、儿童、妊娠期）需要剂量调整。肾功能不全患者使用经肾排泄药物时，需根据肌酐清除率调整：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>cr</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>140</mn><mo>−</mo><mtext>年龄</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mtext>体重(kg)</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>72</mn><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>cr</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>mg/dL</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>女性</mtext><mo>×</mo><mn>0.85</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CL_{\\text{cr}} = \\frac{(140 - \\text{年龄}) \\times \\text{体重(kg)}}{72 \\times S_{\\text{cr}}(\\text{mg/dL})} \\quad (\\text{女性} \\times 0.85)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cr</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">72</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cr</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mg/dL</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">140</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">年龄</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">体重</span><span class=\"mord\">(kg)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">女性</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.85</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这是 Cockcroft-Gault 公式，临床常用于估算肾小球滤过率。</p>\n<p><strong>相互作用审核</strong>：利用药物相互作用数据库筛查潜在 DDI。处方中同时出现 CYP3A4 强抑制剂和 CYP3A4 底物时需高度警惕。</p>\n<p><strong>重复用药审核</strong>：同一患者使用两种以上同类药物（如两种质子泵抑制剂、两种苯二氮卓类）通常为不合理处方。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三-治疗药物监测-tdm\">三、治疗药物监测（TDM）</h3><p>TDM 通过测定血药浓度来指导个体化给药，主要用于治疗窗窄的药物：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>药物</th>\n<th>治疗浓度范围</th>\n<th>中毒浓度</th>\n<th>监测频率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>万古霉素</td>\n<td>谷浓度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10 \\sim 20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> mg/L</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> mg/L</td>\n<td>第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4 \\sim 5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 剂前</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>地高辛</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.5</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>2.0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.5 \\sim 2.0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.0</span></span></span></span></span> ng/mL</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>2.0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 2.0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.0</span></span></span></span></span> ng/mL</td>\n<td>稳态后（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5 \\sim 7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span></span></span></span></span> 天）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>苯妥英钠</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10 \\sim 20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> mg/L</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> mg/L</td>\n<td>剂量调整后 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">7 \\sim 10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> 天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>环孢素</td>\n<td>谷浓度因适应证而异</td>\n<td>肾毒性相关</td>\n<td>移植术后频繁监测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>丙戊酸钠</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50 \\sim 100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span> mg/L</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span> mg/L</td>\n<td>达稳态后</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>锂盐</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.6</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>1.2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.6 \\sim 1.2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.6</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.2</span></span></span></span></span> mmol/L</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 1.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span></span></span></span></span> mmol/L</td>\n<td>每 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3 \\sim 6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span></span> 月</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>TDM 的完整流程：采血时间选择（通常在下一次给药前采谷浓度）→ 实验室分析 → 结合临床情况解读浓度 → 药动学计算调整给药方案 → 再次监测验证。</p>\n<p>苯妥英钠的非线性药动学使其剂量调整尤为复杂。由于 Michaelis-Menten 饱和代谢：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>稳态速率</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{稳态速率} = \\frac{V_{\\max} \\times C_{ss}}{K_m + C_{ss}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">稳态速率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ss</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ss</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>小幅剂量增加可能导致血药浓度急剧升高，必须通过 TDM 精确指导。</p>\n<h3 id=\"四-药物不良反应-adr-监测\">四、药物不良反应（ADR）监测</h3><p>ADR 分为两大类型：</p>\n<p><strong>A 型反应（量变型）</strong>：与药理作用相关，剂量依赖，可预测。如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span>-受体阻滞剂引起心动过缓、ACE 抑制剂引起干咳。</p>\n<p><strong>B 型反应（质变型）</strong>：与药理作用无关，非剂量依赖，不可预测。如青霉素过敏、卡马西平引起的 Stevens-Johnson 综合征（与 HLA-B*1502 基因相关）。</p>\n<p>因果关系评估采用 Naranjo 评分表或 WHO-UMC 系统。Naranjo 评分涵盖以下维度：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>是否有该 ADR 的既往报告？</li>\n<li>不良事件是否在用药后出现？</li>\n<li>停药后是否改善？</li>\n<li>再次用药是否再现？</li>\n<li>是否可以排除其他原因？</li>\n</ul>\n<p>临床药师在 ADR 管理中的角色：早期识别 → 严重性评估 → 建议处理方案（减量、换药、对症治疗）→ 上报国家药品不良反应监测中心 → 更新患者药历标注过敏史。</p>\n<h3 id=\"五-患者用药教育与药学服务\">五、患者用药教育与药学服务</h3><p>有效的用药教育是提高治疗依从性的关键。研究表明，慢性病患者的用药依从率仅约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50%</span></span></span></span></span>，不依从导致的医疗成本和不良结局不可低估。</p>\n<p>用药教育的核心要素（WHAT-HOW-WHY 模型）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>WHAT</strong>：药物名称、规格、外观</li>\n<li><strong>HOW</strong>：用法用量、服药时间、特殊注意事项（如空腹/饭后、避免与某些食物同服）</li>\n<li><strong>WHY</strong>：治疗目的、预期疗效、坚持用药的重要性</li>\n</ul>\n<p>针对特殊人群的教育重点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>老年人</strong>：用药品种精简、防跌倒（镇静药）、大字号用药卡</li>\n<li><strong>儿童患者</strong>：家长教育为主、液体剂型的准确量取、用药时间提醒</li>\n<li><strong>慢性病患者</strong>：自我监测指标（如血糖、血压）、识别需就医的症状</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>一位 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>65</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">65</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">65</span></span></span></span></span> 岁男性患者，体重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>70</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">70</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">70</span></span></span></span></span> kg，血肌酐 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.8</span></span></span></span></span> mg/dL，需要使用万古霉素。使用 Cockcroft-Gault 公式计算其肌酐清除率，并讨论是否需要调整万古霉素的给药方案。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>审核以下处方：患者诊断为社区获得性肺炎，处方包括左氧氟沙星 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>500</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">500</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span></span></span></span></span> mg qd + 阿奇霉素 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>500</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">500</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span></span></span></span></span> mg qd。分析这一联合方案的合理性（提示：QT 间期延长风险）。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>某患者服用华法林期间 INR 一直稳定在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.5</span></span></span></span></span>，近期因关节疼痛自行加服布洛芬后 INR 升至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4.8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4.8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4.8</span></span></span></span></span>。分析可能的机制并提出处理建议。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>设计一份针对 2 型糖尿病患者的二甲双胍用药教育方案，涵盖 WHAT-HOW-WHY 三个维度。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>某院临床药师发现 ICU 中万古霉素 TDM 的达标率仅为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>40</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">40\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40%</span></span></span></span></span>。提出改进 TDM 服务的系统性方案。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>《临床药学》</strong>（蔡卫民主编）：国内临床药学核心教材</li>\n<li><strong>&quot;Clinical Pharmacy and Therapeutics&quot; (Cate Whittlesea)</strong>：英文经典教材</li>\n<li><strong>UpToDate</strong>：循证临床决策支持工具，药物信息模块丰富</li>\n<li><strong>国家药品不良反应监测中心</strong> (<a href=\"https://www.cdr-adr.org.cn)：ADR\">https://www.cdr-adr.org.cn)：ADR</a> 报告和查询平台</li>\n<li><strong>ACCP (American College of Clinical Pharmacy)</strong> 临床药学实践指南</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>临床药学是药学走向临床、服务患者的核心实践学科。药物治疗管理提供了系统化的工作框架，处方审核是保障用药安全的第一道关卡，TDM 为窄治疗窗药物的个体化给药提供了精确手段，ADR 监测则守护着药物治疗的安全底线。作为未来的临床药师，不仅需要扎实的药学知识功底，还需要具备与医生和患者有效沟通的能力，以及持续学习循证医学证据的习惯。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学药学 — 临床药学实践","id":"大学药学-临床药学实践"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、药物治疗管理（MTM）","id":"一-药物治疗管理-mtm"},{"level":3,"text":"二、处方审核与合理用药","id":"二-处方审核与合理用药"},{"level":3,"text":"三、治疗药物监测（TDM）","id":"三-治疗药物监测-tdm"},{"level":3,"text":"四、药物不良反应（ADR）监测","id":"四-药物不良反应-adr-监测"},{"level":3,"text":"五、患者用药教育与药学服务","id":"五-患者用药教育与药学服务"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学药学 — 药品质量控制与分析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/pharmacy/pharmaceutical-preparation/pharmaceutical-quality"},"next":{"title":"大学药学 — 药品监管与法规","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/pharmacy/pharmacy-practice/drug-regulation"}}